cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Reproducible CTW alignment pipeline for syllable-production modeling (Interspeech 2026 submission 2479)"
message: >-
  If you use this software or data, please cite both this repository (Zenodo
  DOI below), the companion article "Assessing a Mathematical Model of Syllable
  Production via CTW Alignment with EMA Data" (F. Berthommier, Univ. Grenoble
  Alpes, CNRS, Grenoble INP, GIPSA-lab, France), and the original EMA corpus:
  J. Kasper, C. A. Kell, P. Perrier, "An informational account of anticipatory
  coarticulation – theoretical considerations and empirical plausibility",
  Journal of Neurolinguistics 78, 101298, 2026,
  doi:10.1016/j.jneuroling.2025.101298 (data transmitted personally by the
  authors).
